# Build context for docker/Dockerfile, which copies exactly two files out of the
# repository -- .github/highfive-version and docker/ci.sh. The sources it builds
# arrive at run time through a bind mount, not through the context, so anything
# large here is pure transfer cost.
#
# The generated fixtures alone are well over a hundred megabytes, and build/ on a
# developer machine is larger still. With these excluded the context is about ten
# kilobytes.
build/
out/
install/
cmake-build-*/
.git/
*.h5
test/baselines/
CMakeUserPresets.json
